<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Compiler Construction on Jaideep M. More</title><link>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/</link><description>Recent content in Compiler Construction on Jaideep M. More</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Syntax Analysis</title><link>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/syntax-analysis/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/syntax-analysis/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="context-free-grammars">Context Free Grammars:&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>Is a tuple &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>G&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>=&lt;/mo>&lt;mo stretchy="false">(&lt;/mo>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mi>N&lt;/mi>&lt;/msub>&lt;mo separator="true">,&lt;/mo>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mi>T&lt;/mi>&lt;/msub>&lt;mo separator="true">,&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>P&lt;/mi>&lt;mo separator="true">,&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>S&lt;/mi>&lt;mo stretchy="false">)&lt;/mo>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G = (V_{N}, V_{T}, P, S)&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mi>n&lt;/mi>&lt;/msub>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{n}&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>: Set of non terminals&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mi>T&lt;/mi>&lt;/msub>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{T}&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>: Set of terminals&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>S&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>S&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>∈&lt;/mo>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mi>N&lt;/mi>&lt;/msub>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S \in V_{N}&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span> Start Symbol&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>P&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>P&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>⊆&lt;/mo>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mi>N&lt;/mi>&lt;/msub>&lt;mo>×&lt;/mo>&lt;mo stretchy="false">(&lt;/mo>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mi>N&lt;/mi>&lt;/msub>&lt;mo>∪&lt;/mo>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mi>T&lt;/mi>&lt;/msub>&lt;msup>&lt;mo stretchy="false">)&lt;/mo>&lt;mo>∗&lt;/mo>&lt;/msup>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P \subseteq V_{N} \times (V_{N} \cup V_{T})^*&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span> Are set of rules that map non-terminals to a set of terminals and non-terminals&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h3 id="reduced-and-extended-cfgs">Reduced and Extended CFGs:&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>A non terminal &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>A&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span> is&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>reachable&lt;/strong> iff: there exists &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>φ&lt;/mi>&lt;mn>1&lt;/mn>&lt;/msub>&lt;mo separator="true">,&lt;/mo>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>φ&lt;/mi>&lt;mn>2&lt;/mn>&lt;/msub>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varphi_{1}, \varphi_{2}&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span> such that &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>S&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>⟹&lt;/mo>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>φ&lt;/mi>&lt;mn>1&lt;/mn>&lt;/msub>&lt;mi>A&lt;/mi>&lt;msub>&lt;mi>φ&lt;/mi>&lt;mn>2&lt;/mn>&lt;/msub>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S \Longrightarrow \varphi_{1} A \varphi_{2}&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>productive&lt;/strong> iff: &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>A&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>⟹&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>w&lt;/mi>&lt;mtext> &lt;/mtext>&lt;mi mathvariant="normal">∣&lt;/mi>&lt;mtext> &lt;/mtext>&lt;mi>w&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>∈&lt;/mo>&lt;msubsup>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mi>T&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>∗&lt;/mo>&lt;/msubsup>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A \Longrightarrow w \ |\ w \in V_{T}^*&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>A grammar is a &lt;mark>reduced grammar&lt;/mark> if it has neither unreachable nor non-productive non-terminals.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Semantic Analysis</title><link>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/semantic-analysis/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/semantic-analysis/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="parse-trees-and-ast">Parse Trees and AST:&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>Parse trees contains terminals that are used to make the grammar non-ambiguous. Ex: semicolons are used to make the grammar unambiguous.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>We also remove non-terminals for chain productions.
&lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>A&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>→&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>B&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>⋯&lt;/mo>&lt;mo>→&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>C&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>→&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>a&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>⟹&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>A&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>→&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>a&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A \rightarrow B \cdots \rightarrow C \rightarrow a \Longrightarrow A \rightarrow a&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="semantic-analysis">Semantic Analysis:&lt;/h3>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>Refute at compile time the programs that potentially get stuck&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Infer information about program helpful for compiler&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;h3 id="name-analysis">Name Analysis:&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>Ensures each occurrence of an entity refers to a unique defining occurrence.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Program Analysis</title><link>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/program-analysis/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/program-analysis/</guid><description>&lt;ol>
