&lt;h3 id="dead-code-analysis">Dead Code Analysis:&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>Goal: To eliminate the computation whose result is unused&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Definition: A variable &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>x&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span> is live at a program point in the CFG if there is a path from this program point to another program point where this variable is used which is not a definition.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Intermediate Representation</title><link>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/intermediate-representation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/intermediate-representation/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="control-flow-graphs">Control Flow Graphs:&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>Each instruction in a function has a set of possible successor instruction in that function&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mtext>CFG&lt;/mtext>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{CFG}&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span> is a Directed Graph &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mo stretchy="false">(&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;mo separator="true">,&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>E&lt;/mi>&lt;mo separator="true">,&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>r&lt;/mi>&lt;mo stretchy="false">)&lt;/mo>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(V, E, r)&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>: instructions of the function&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>E&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mo stretchy="false">(&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>v&lt;/mi>&lt;mo separator="true">,&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>w&lt;/mi>&lt;mo stretchy="false">)&lt;/mo>&lt;mo>∈&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>E&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(v, w) \in E&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span> iff &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>v&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span> is a possible successor of &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>v&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>r&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>: is the root node with no predecessor&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>IR’s typically are intra-functional and control flow between functions is not modelled by CFGs&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="basic-blocks">Basic Blocks:&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>Is a sequence of instructions with the following properties.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>SSA - Single Static Assignment</title><link>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/ssa---single-static-assignment/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Phoenix009.github.io/notes/compiler-construction/ssa---single-static-assignment/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="problem-and-motivation">Problem and Motivation:&lt;/h3>
&lt;p>For constant propagation analysis, we have to store the mapping &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mtext>Vars&lt;/mtext>&lt;mo>↦&lt;/mo>&lt;msubsup>&lt;mi>Z&lt;/mi>&lt;mi mathvariant="normal">⊥&lt;/mi>&lt;mi mathvariant="normal">⊤&lt;/mi>&lt;/msubsup>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Vars} \mapsto Z^{\top}_{\bot}&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span> for every program point &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>. Thus the space requirement is &lt;span class="katex">&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">&lt;semantics>&lt;mrow>&lt;mi mathvariant="normal">∣&lt;/mi>&lt;mtext>Vars&lt;/mtext>&lt;mi mathvariant="normal">∣&lt;/mi>&lt;mo>×&lt;/mo>&lt;mi>V&lt;/mi>&lt;/mrow>&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\text{Vars}| \times V&lt;/annotation>&lt;/semantics>&lt;/math>&lt;/span>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>To reduce this storage space we can do flow-insensitive constant propagation where instead of storing the analysis for each program point we do it for the entire CFG.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>So we solve the single equation that combines the program analysis for each program point into one&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>